<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">1KO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃kaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola baal a Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃kaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolinte</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu eli ntam Pool. Ndɛ mbuul wu ábuo ebvɔɔn li bviil li Kolinte me mvel wu ãku-ãtaan y'ɔ̃mɔ̃ (51) me dzwɛ e ndɛ li mbuaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:1-18">Ɛ̃sa 18.1-18</ref></char>). Bvɔɔn olɔ, li enduru okuun onse ɔ̃sal a ndɛ wueel. Ndɛ okal ke Kolinte nku-a-nku a mvel yuaal.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me lio e Pool, bviil li Kolinte éli me baal nku-a-nku amiil ɛ̃nkam nsiaan (700.000). Oŋɔ̃, yam bwɛn a yam éli y'emfa e lɔ ki abuɛɛn: Agelek ye ki bɔ, Alomɛ̃ ye ki bɔ, baal ba k'etswi ki epal tal ye ki bɔ hɛ̃. Oŋɔ̃, éli ye nkɔɔl yi ékeyiool anga-ãyal baal. Kɛn okɔ, opfel b'eluɔ y'ãndɔɔ m'ãbiil epfuũ bvi ngesɛ ékedzuu nkuul mɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãndɔɔ mã nkiin m'ã́tam Pool k'akel ɔ̃nkaan wu ãli mã. Nsia yi mbi yi éyɔɔ ndɛ yi éwi baal a Kelohe ndɛ ndiri eli y'ɛ̃kɔɔl onse Ebvɔɔn, mi ɛ̃si kwɛn baal ayii m'ãnkel-m'ãnkel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1-11">1–11</ref></char>). Ɔ̃nkaan wu éyɔɔ ndɛ wu áfi ol'Ebvɔɔn li Kolinte wɛn, bɔ áfuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul m'ãndɔɔ m'emfa bwɛn emfa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool okel bɔ ɔ̃nkaan sua mvel wu ãku-ãtaan y'anã ye wu ãku-ãtaan y'ataan. Ndɛ owi ɛ̃mveel m'ɛ̃mfuul ɛ̃ bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:6">1.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:20">1.10–4.20</ref></char>), bvool me nkuul a ãtee ã ndɛ, ndɛ osuo Ebvɔɔn nkuul.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãndɔɔ bibi m'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ãsuo akiool emfa ki adzuu onse Ebvɔɔn.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool wu áti mbel k'ekal ntam a Yeso Mãsia m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. Mɛ̃ nswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu bwɛn a ndoo Sositɛn. <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Mɛ̃ nkel ndɛ ol'Ebvɔɔn e Nziã li ke bviil li Kolinte, ola b'ali baal a Nziã me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. Nziã oti bɔ mbel k'akal ba ngel, ye baal bueel bɛn ãmboo mbueel abebiool nkuũ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, ndɛ wu Mfam a bɔ, wu Mfam a bia-byɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ, ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia, asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bvel li abɔɔ onse Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ãlio mbueel mɛ̃ ebetuɛɛn Nziã a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, me ndɔɔ a nyiĩ yi esio ndɛ byɛ me bvoo a byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ngwanyã, me bvoo a byɛ ye Mãsia, Nziã owi byɛ opfel b'emfa bwɛn emfa, opfel b'endɔɔ ye b'oyɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, otsweel b'átsweel Mãsia, byɛ ekiool bɔ ye mpɛn yueel. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Meba, byɛ k'eywɛn a kab e Nziã si ngemɔ̃ wɛ, ŋ'ebekiaal byɛ kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia amɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ndɛ kieel wu awa byɛ mpɛn tiil ntɔ, kwɛn byɛ ebee y'elyal okal, me tsoo li èya Mfam Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nziã oli wu obvaan m'okiool: Ndɛ wu áti byɛ mbel yi ekal me bvoo ye Muaan a ndɛ, wu Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okab onse Ebvɔɔn li Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Andoo a mɛ̃, me nkuũ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ luo wɛn ekal ɔ̃nywã ngɔmɔ̃: Yɔɔl kwɛn okab obee okal onse byɛ. Ekal m'ɔ̃dzi, ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ãtsam ngãmɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, andoo, baal ba yam li Kelohe awi mɛ̃ nsia ndiri eli y'ɛ̃kɔɔl onse byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Mɛ̃ nzii k'eyɛɛn bubu: Ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ abeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wa Pool», wɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wu Apolos», wɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wa Sefas eli nkuũ a Piɛɛl m'ɔ̃nywã wu Alamɛɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:42">Dzã 1.42</ref></char></note>», wɛn bvool ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wa Mãsia». <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Byɛ etsam wɛn Mãsia ákab? Pool wu ábɛɛl m'enkulusu me ndɔɔ a byɛ? Byɛ opongo me nkuũ a Pool éwel bɔ? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Mɛ̃ etuɛɛn Nziã me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ke ngwi mbuul ɔ̃kyam onse byɛ opongo wɛ, bengwi mɛ̃ opongo kɛn a Kilisipos ye Gayios. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Obobɔ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'oyɛɛn wɛn byɛ ewel opongo me nkuũ a mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Ee, taa-taa, onkyel mɛ̃ ewi baal a nzɔ a Sitefanas hɛ̃ opongo. Kɛn a mɛ̃ etsam mpii mɛ̃ ke ngwi mbuul ɔ̃kyam opongo wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Mãsia k'ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi ewa baal opongo wɛ, ndɛ yuɔɔl mɛ̃ Nsia yi Ngesɛ otsal. Mɛ̃ ke yensal yɔ m'ãyal m'oyɛɛn m'ombuul wɛ, kwɛn epfu e Mãsia m'enkulusu ebee mpɛn oywɛn.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Mãsia oli waan y'ãyal ã Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ngwanyã, ãtee m'ãtal enkulusu ãli owool me b'ayi k'odziɔɔn. Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ b'eli me nkuul yi obvuul, ãtee omɔ̃ ãli waan e Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">«Mɛ̃ ekieel ebiil ontwel b'antwel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">mɛ̃ ekieel eta ãyal m'anga-ãyal nsal.»<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />M'emfa okyɛ, ntwel a ndɛ? Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel a ndɛ? Nga-ãyal wa lio li a ndɛ? Nziã ŋ'asuo kwɛn otwel b'ɔ̃kiri oli owool!<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Ngwanyã, baal b'ɔ̃kiri m'ãyal ã bɔ akwɛɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã ŋ'esuo ndɛ bɔ ãyal ã ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Nziã owɛɛ k'abvuul b'akiool me nkuul etee li eli onge owool. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ayuda abesɔɔ eliĩ, Agelek abebii ãyal. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Kwɛn ŋɛn, bee bam Mãsia wu ábɛɛl m'enkulusu ebetee. Me ndɔɔ Ayuda, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ebal bɔ, bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ atsam ndiri eli owool. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Kɛn a me b'eti Nziã mbel, ekal Ayuda, ekal Agelek, Mãsia oli waan e Nziã, bvool oli ãyal ã Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, kyɛn ndiri owool o Nziã enduru ãyal ã baal, kyɛn ndiri okwal o Nziã ebvel mpɛn a baal.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">B'esueel Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Andoo, etal emfa ki éti Nziã byɛ mbel: Onse byɛ, anga-ãyal m'emfa ki ombuul k'ali bibi wɛ, anga-waan k'ali bibi wɛ, b'ewa baal bvɛɛ k'ali bibi hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Kɛn a Nziã osueel ãndɔɔ m'owool onse ɔ̃kiri, m'owa b'anga-ãyal opfuru. Ndɛ osueel mã y'okwal onse ɔ̃kiri, m'owa b'anga-mpɛn opfuru. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nziã osueel mɛn otsɛn pyɛ onse ɔ̃kiri, m' efiɛɛn baal, mɛn k'ãli wɛ, m'osuul o m'ãli ngwel-a-ngwel. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul k'abɛɛl ntwel ke nkwel a Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Nziã wu obvool bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. Ndɛ wu Yeso Mãsia oyii ãyal m'ãfi ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. Me nkuul a ndɛ, Nziã osuul bia-byɛ dzu, osueel bia-byɛ k'ekal ba ndɛ, bvool obvuul bia-byɛ m'obi. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />M'emfa okyɛ, onge b'ákel, «yɔɔl kwɛn wu abɛɛl ntwel, abɛɛl yɔ onse Mfam!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:22-23">Dzo 9.22-23</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Otee o Mãsia wu ábɛɛl m'enkulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Andoo, me b'otal mɛ̃, ŋ'eyi mɛ̃ ola byɛ me ndɔɔ yi etee byɛ ãndɔɔ ã Nziã mã m'edziɔɔn, mɛ̃ k'eyi onge mbuul wu onduru etiaal li oyɛɛn, wuo onge mbuul wu y'ãyal wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ k'edzii k'eyɛɛ ndɔɔ si mɔ̃ onse byɛ, ndɔɔ yi edzii k'eyɛɛ mɛ̃ kɛn a Yeso Mãsia, Yeso Mãsia wu ábɛɛl m'enkulusu. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Myam éli ke nkwel a byɛ y'okwal, ye buɔ, y'etiɔɔl lueel. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />M'ékeyɛɛn mɛ̃ ye m'ékeyiool mɛ̃ k'ã́kefa m'ãyɛɛn m'ãyal m'ombuul m'ãywɛɛn baal k'akiool wɛ, kɛn a mɔ̃ ã́kefa me waan li Ɔ̃fel li ékemɔɔn onse mɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />M'emfa okyɛ, okiool o byɛ k'okal sɔɔ nkal ãyal ã baal wɛ, bɔ okal sɔɔ nkal a waan e Nziã.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyal m'ãfa ola Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Kɛn a bee hɛ̃ ebetee ãyal ol'akiool b'amaawam onse okiool. Kɛn ãyal omɔ̃ k'ãli m'ɔ̃kiri wu wɛ. Mɔ̃ hɛ̃ k'ãli mi ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi ɛ̃li y'okwɛn nkal ɔ̃kiri wu wɛ, mi ɛ̃kieel ɛ̃siɛɛn k'odziɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Bee ebetee ãyal ã Nziã, mɛn baal k'ákeyɛɛ wɛ bvool m'ã́li m'edziɔɔn. Kɛn a ye k'ebɛɛn ɔ̃kiri, Nziã ál'amaayɛɛl ãyal omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi awa bia-byɛ lweel. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Mbiri si ngɔ̃mɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kiri wu k'áyɛɛ ãyal omɔ̃ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn bɔ áyɛɛ mɔ̃, bɔ k'ákaabɛɛl Mfam a lweel m'enkulusu wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Kɛn ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">«Ãndɔɔ mɛn dziil k'emwɛn wɛ, mɛn tswi k'eyoo wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">mɛn mbuul k'abɔɔ ãtsam ã mɔ̃ wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Nziã ofaal mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a b'adzii ndɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:3">Edz 64.3</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Kɛn ola bia-byɛ, Nziã osuo mɔ̃ m'Ɔ̃fel. Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel oyɛɛ mbueel, onkyam ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ Nziã mi ɛ̃li myam m'edziɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Mbuul nã onse baal wu oyɛɛ ãtsam ã mbuul? Wu oyɛɛ mɔ̃ eli kɛn ɔ̃fel a ndyam wu oli onse ndɛ. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ ãtsam ã Nziã wɛ, wu oyɛɛ mɔ̃ eli kɛn Ɔ̃fel a Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ke yam, ɔ̃fel wu eyɔɔ bia-byɛ k'ali ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃kiri wɛ, bia-byɛ eyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu ofi ola Nziã, kwɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛ m'ewi Nziã bia-byɛ me nyiĩ a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Bee k'eyɛɛn mɔ̃ m'oyɛɛn b'ãyal m'ombuul wɛ, bee eyɛɛn mɔ̃ m'ãyɛɛn m'eyiool Ɔ̃fel a Nziã. Obobɔ, bee ebeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'Ɔ̃fel m'ãyɛɛn m'Ɔ̃fel ondɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Kɛn a mbuul wu abetsam kɛn a m'emfa ki ombuul k'akiool ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ol'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã wɛ. Mɔ̃ ãli owool me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ k'akoo k'akwaal mɔ̃ otsɛn wɛ. Ngwanyã, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu asa kwɛn mbuul akyɛɛl mɔ̃ ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Mbuul wu adzuu m'Ɔ̃fel abekyɛɛl mbueel, kɛn a ndɛ, mbuul wu akyɛɛl ndɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">«Wu ayɛɛ ãtsam ã Mfam nã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">m'owa o ndɛ luo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Edz 40.13</ref></char></note>?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kɛn a bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ eli y'ãtsam ã Mãsia.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akiool bɛn kɛn awam wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Andoo, me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn ye byɛ onge b'ayɛɛn ye baal b'adzuu m'Ɔ̃fel wɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ye byɛ onge b'ayɛɛn ye baal b'adzuu m'emfa ki ombuul, onge b'ayɛɛn ye baan b'abwee onse Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ ãbiaal, mɛ̃ ke ngwi byɛ bvi-odza bvi ye mpɛn wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ al'olɔ k'ekoo k'edza bvɛ wɛ. Onkyam meba, byɛ olɔ k'ekoo wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ kɛn ebekal m'emfa ki ombuul. Onge bɛn onse byɛ eli y'ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ y'obel, ke ŋɛn byɛ kɛn ebekal m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ? Emfa ki ebedzuu byɛ okyɛ, ke ki ombuul wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Ŋɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wa Pool!» Wukyɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wu Apolos!» Byɛ ke ŋ'esa ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asal a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Apolos nã ali? Pool hɛ̃ nã ndi? Bee ange-buaal mpii kɛn asal a Nziã eli! Me nkuul a bee, byɛ eyii akiool. Ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ asal m'emfa ki etam Mfam osa. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Mɛ̃ wu nkwɛn, Apolos wu oyiri ãdza, kɛn a Nziã wu osi kwɛn ekwɛn ekwel. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Obobɔ, wu akwɛn, k'ali y'otsɛn wɛ, wu ayiri ãdza hɛ̃, k'ali y'otsɛn wɛ, wu oli y'otsɛn eli kɛn a Nziã wu asa kwɛn ekwɛn ekwel. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Wu akwɛn ye wu ayiri ãdza ali nsiil, kɛn a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akieel abɔɔ furu m'emfa ki ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee eli b'ebesal ye Nziã. Byɛ eli nguun a Nziã, byɛ hɛ̃ eli nzɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />M'emfa ki esio Nziã mɛ̃ nyiĩ a ndɛ, mɛ̃ ndɔ ãnkɔɔn ke nsɛn, onge ɔ̃tuu wu ɔ̃bvɛ. Mbuul ɔ̃kyam atuu ke ywel a mɔ̃. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal y'onkyab m'emfa ki etuu ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul ɔ̃kyam k'akoo m'olɔ o nkɔɔn yi nkiin nkyam ke mboo yi amaalɔ tsɔɔn wɛ, nkɔɔn oyɔ eli Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Mbuul okoo k'atuu nkal a nkɔɔn oyɔ me ɔɔl, me aadzã, m'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn, me nkwii, me nsyel wuo me bviĩ. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ndɔɔ pyɛ! Kɛn ɔ̃sal a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akieel amɔɔn, bvool baal akieel ayɛɛ ndɛ me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ. Me tsoo olɔ, ekieel ekal ye mbaa, yɔ ekieel esuo emfa ki ɔ̃sal a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Okɛɛn mbuul otuu nzɔ yɛn k'edzio wɛ, mbuul ondɛ akieel abɔɔ ebva-kab. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃sal a mbuul odzio, ndɛ àywɛn a ebva-kab. Ndɛ àbvuul, kɛn obvuul obɔ òkal olɔ yɛɛn wɛn mbuul wu opal onse mbaa. <verse eid="1CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Byɛ eli Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal abekal onse byɛ. Byɛ k'eyɛɛ obobɔ wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Mbuul abiil nzɔ a Nziã, Nziã àbiil ndɛ hɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, nzɔ a Nziã eli ɔ̃nsensal: Nzɔ a Nziã oyɔ mpii byɛ.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bvieel eli bvi byɛ, kɛn a byɛ eli ba Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee nzuru a ndyam opfuru. Okɛɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ atsam ndiri ndɛ oli y'ãyal m'emfa ki ɔ̃kiri wu, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ akal ye laa m'okal y'ãyal! <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãyal m'ɔ̃kiri wu ãli laa ke nkwel a Nziã. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Nziã abebɔɔ anga-ãyal me pfuru e bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:13">Dzo 5.13</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Bvool ákel ndiri: «Mfam oyɛɛ ãtsam m'ãnga-ãyal, ndɛ oyɛɛ kwɛn mɔ̃ otsɛn pyɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Ãnz 94.11</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul abee ntwel obɛɛl me ndɔɔ a angaburu-baal, ke ngwel wɛ bvieel eli bvi byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ekal Pool, ekal Apolos, ekal Sefas, ekal ɔ̃kiri, ekal elaã, ekal epfu, ekal lio li meba, ekal lio li èya: Bvieel eli bvi byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ eli ba Mãsia, Mãsia oli wa Nziã.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wu atsiil ãndɔɔ kɛn a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />M'emfa okyɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn baal awal bee onge asal a Mãsia, bvool b'atal ãndɔɔ ã Nziã mã m'edziɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />M'asɔɔ ola mbuul wu atal ãndɔɔ, bɛn ndɛ akal mbuul wɛn ebvaan ata kaã me ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, ekal byɛ ekyɛɛl mɛ̃, ekal baal akyɛɛl mɛ̃, obɔ k'otal mɛ̃ wɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'ebekyɛɛl nzuru a myam wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mɛ̃ ke ndi y'elyal ki ekyɛɛl mɛ̃ nzuru me ndɔɔ a kyɛ wɛ, ke ŋengyɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃nkinkyam wɛ: Mfam wu akyɛɛl mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Obobɔ, ebee ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ otsiil ye k'ekoo lio li éwɛɛ Mfam, ye k'eya ndɛ wu akieel apaal ãndɔɔ m'empeel ke mwiĩ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ akieel asuo ãtsam ã baal kal-a-kal. Obobɔ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akieel abɔɔ otuɛɛn o ndɛ b'ofa ola Nziã.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpal yi emwɛn antam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nti mboo yi etal Apolos ye myam me ndɔɔ a byɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ eluɛɛn a kuul e bee m'oyio o ndɔɔ yi: «Ebee ɔ̃ndel wu ãndɔɔ m'ákel onduru». M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul onse byɛ k'akal y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, b'akal ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ ye wu abyal wukyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ki enduru yɛ bakyɛ m'emã? Bvieel bvi eli a yɛ, wu ewi yɛ bvɛ Nziã, k'obobɔ wɛ? Okɛɛn awi yɛ bvɛ m'owa, k'otsɛn omã b'endɛɛl yɛ nzuru, olɔ yɛɛn wɛn k'awi yɛ bvɛ m'owa wɛ?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Byɛ emeebɔɔ bvieel bvi edzii byɛ! Byɛ eyii apfel! Byɛ eyii akwɛn, kɛn a bee, bee k'eli bɔ wɛ. Oŋɔ̃ ekal akwɛn bam taa-taa, kwɛn bee ekal m'okwɛn ye byɛ! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ke yam, bee b'antam, Nziã osuul bee baal b'ãmbee, onge baal b'awi etumbu ki epfu. Ngwanyã, bee eli onge baal b'apaal ke taan ke nkwel ɔ̃kiri wueel, ke nkwel ãnzwel, bvool ke nkwel a baal. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Bee bam eli anga-laa me ndɔɔ a Mãsia, kɛn a byɛ bam eli anga-ãyal me bvoo a byɛ ye Mãsia. Bee bam eli y'okwal, kɛn a byɛ bam eli ye mpɛn. Byɛ bam eli ye dzuun, kɛn a bee bam, ambaal bee dzuun. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Tiil meba ŋã, bee ebemwɛn fool li nzal, li nzuaal, li odzuũ, li ɔ̃dzii ye li omwiĩ b'adzuu pwel-a-pwel. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Bee ebebam nzuru m'osal me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bee-myam. Baal abetoo bee, kɛn a bee ebendɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl, bɔ abetuaal bee mpal, kɛn a bee ebekuru ɔ̃kwal. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Abekwee bee, kɛn a bee ebewɛɛl baal. Tiil meba ŋã, bee eyii onge eluɔ bvi nsyel-nsyel bvi ɔ̃kiri, onge eluɔ bvi abetyal onse yal bvi baal bueel.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo e Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Mɛ̃ ke nkel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi ewa byɛ opfuru wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ edzuru byɛ ãtswi onge baan a mɛ̃ ba dzii. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn byɛ ebɔɔ ambiri amiil kuun (10.000) onse Mãsia, byɛ k'eli y'atal bibi wɛ: Mɛ̃ wu mburu byɛ onse Yeso Mãsia, ŋ'etee mɛ̃ byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ewa byɛ luo wɛn, enɔɔn kuul e mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Obɔ otsɛn be ngyuɔɔl mɛ̃ byɛ Timote. Ndɛ oli muaan a mɛ̃ wa dzii bvool wu okuru nzuru me Nziã, onse Mfam. Ndɛ àyeel byɛ emfa ki edzuu mɛ̃ onse [Yeso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yeso</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ŋã k'ákel onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi nsɔɔn-nsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>] Mãsia. Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ebesuo mɛ̃ ãmboo mbueel, onse ãbvɔɔn mbueel.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Onge bɛn baal bakyɛ áketsam ndiri mɛ̃ ol'olɔ ke ngyi byɛ otal wɛ, bɔ abvi nzuru ondɛɛl. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Kɛn okɛɛn Mfam odzii, mɛ̃ èya byɛ otal alili ŋã. M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ k'èyɛɛ ãyɛɛn ã b'ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru wɛ, mɛ̃ èyɛɛ ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ akoo m'osa. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Okwɛn o Nziã k'oli ndɔɔ a ãyɛɛn wɛ, bɔ eli ndɔɔ yi waan. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Ki edzii byɛ emã? Kwɛn mɛ̃ ngya byɛ otal ye sikɔrɔ, wuo mɛ̃ ngya y'ɔ̃kwal wa dzii y'efyɛ?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'esio onse Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Baal abeyɛɛn ãmboo mbueel ndiri ola byɛ baal bakyɛ ali onse ãndɔɔ m'esio, m'emfa kyɛn onkyam baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ k'asa obobɔ wɛ. Ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ ndiri abedzuu y'ɔ̃kal a tal. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Kɛn a byɛ eluul m'ondɛɛl o nzuru. Ke yam, byɛ kɛn b'ekeekal y'ãwua, tiil k'etswɛɛl byɛ mbuul wu asa ndɔɔ yi obobɔ onse byɛ! <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, onkyam ŋɛn me nzuru mɛ̃ ke ndi ye byɛ wɛ, m'ɔ̃fel mɛ̃ ndi ye byɛ. Mɛ̃ emeetsiil ndɔɔ a mbuul wu osi obobɔ, olɔ yɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ eli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ŋ'èbvɔɔn byɛ me nkuũ a Yeso Mãsia, mɛ̃ èkal ye byɛ m'ɔ̃fel, waan e Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso èkal ye byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Oŋɔ̃ etiɔ mbuul wa m'emfa okyɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Satana. M'emfa okyɛ, nzuru a ndɛ èbii, kɛn ɔ̃fel a ndɛ àbvuul me tsoo li èya Mfam. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Otsɛn b'akal y'ondɛɛl o nzuru k'oli wɛ! Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛn lebviil etsi-etsiri esa kwɛn pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ afel wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Embaal lebviil wa tsɔɔn, kwɛn byɛ ekal pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ wa alili, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'ebekal ye lebviil wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Mãsia wu Onduru o bia-byɛ áwi ndɛ kab. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Obobɔ, ebɛɛl pfuun li Onduru, ke ye lebviil wa tsɔɔn wɛ, ke ye lebviil wu obi wuo ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi wɛ, y'amampa bɛn k'abiin wɛ b'otsɛtsɛ ye b'otaa-taa.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Onse ɔ̃nkaan a mɛ̃ ɔ̃kyam, mɛ̃ ekel byɛ wɛn ebee okal y'ondoo ye baal b'awa nzuru m'ãndɔɔ m'esio. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Mɛ̃ ke ngyiɛɛn wɛn ebee y'ondoo ye baal b'asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri wu okal wɛ. Baal obɔ baal a pfuul, ba ye nzal a obɔɔ, b'abebuɛɛn etiɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, al'okɛɛn obobɔ, byɛ ol'ekeepal onse ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Be nkel mɛ̃ byɛ, bɛn byɛ ebee y'ondoo okal ye mbuul ndyam wueel wɛn kwɛn k'ɔ̃nywã ndiri ndoo, kɛn a ndɛ owi nzuru m'ãndɔɔ m'esio, me nzal a obɔɔ, m'obuɛɛn b'etiɔ, m'etoo b'ɛ̃tswɛ, m'obɔɔ o mbal, wuo owi nzuru me pfuul. Ebee onkyam k'edza ye mbuul wu obobɔ. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal ke ba Mãsia wɛ mɛ̃? B'atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal b'Ebvɔɔn ke byɛ wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Baal bɛn ke ba Mãsia wɛ, wu àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ Nziã. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: «Etswɛɛl mbuul wu ɔ̃bi onse byɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Det 17.7</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Akiool ayii abva bakyɛ ãmbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ŋɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli y'eka ye wumɔ̃, m'emã ndɛ ayi ndɛ ofɛn ke mbal a baal bɛn k'akiool wɛ, ke mboo yi ekeebiri ndɛ ndɛ ke nkwel a ba ngel? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ wɛn ba ngel akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri wu? Okɛɛn b'akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri wu byɛ, obobɔ byɛ ol'ekwɛɛn k'etsiil endo-ndɔɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ ekieel etsiil ãndɔɔ m'ãnzwel wɛ? Obobɔ, byɛ ol'ekwɛɛn k'esoo ãndɔɔ m'omwiĩ ba? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Okɛɛn byɛ eli y'eka ye bakyɛ m'ãndɔɔ m'omwiĩ ba, bɛn b'ewal byɛ onge antwel baal bɛn Ebvɔɔn k'ekaal bɔ dzii wɛ! <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ opfuru. Onse byɛ, k'eli ye mbuul wu oli y'ontwel, wɛn okoo k'asoo ãndɔɔ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ andoo wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Bɛn ɔ̃kiool afɛn wumɔ̃, ofɛn bvool ke nkwel a baal bɛn k'ali akiool wɛ!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Me b'otal byɛ, ŋ'eyii etɔ byɛ ke bakyɛ ofɛn, eyɛɛ wɛn obɔ obva o byɛ bam. M'emã byɛ k'ekuru ɔ̃kwal ŋ'asa byɛ ndɔɔ yi mbi wɛ? M'emã byɛ k'ekiool wɛn awɛɛl byɛ eluɔ wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />B'asa ãndɔɔ m'ãbi byɛ, b'awɛɛl bakyɛ eluɔ byɛ! B'esa byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ okal bvool andoo a byɛ! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ wɛn b'asa ãndɔɔ m'ãbi kieel k'asam Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ? Ekal y'onkyab, eyɛɛ bam bubu: anga-esio, b'abuɛɛn etiɔ, b'adzuu y'anga-akal wuo y'anga-alam, b'adzuu y'angaburu-abɔɔl, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />baal a pfuul, ba ye nzal a obɔɔ, b'ebɔɔ mbal, b'atoo bakyɛ ɛ̃tswɛ, b'awɛɛl eluɔ e baal, bɔ kieel k'asam Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Okyɛ emfa ki éli baal ke kwɛ onse byɛ tsɔɔn. Kɛn a Nziã osuɔɔl byɛ, osueel byɛ, osuul byɛ dzu me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso Mãsia, me nkuul Ɔ̃fel a Nziã a bia-byɛ.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elweel Nziã m'ãnzuru ã byɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Baal bakyɛ abeyɛɛn ndiri: «Awi mɛ̃ nkuul yi esa mbueel». Ngwanyã, kɛn a mbueel k'ãli ngesɛ wɛ. «Awi mɛ̃ nkuul yi esa mbueel», kɛn a mɛ̃ ke nzii k'ekal ɔ̃nkyal a ndɔɔ si mɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Baal bakyɛ bvool abeyɛɛn ndiri: «Bvi-odza eli me ndɔɔ ɔ̃la, ɔ̃la hɛ̃ oli me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza.» Ngwanya, kɛn a Nziã akieel abiil bvi-odza y'ɔ̃la. Kɛn a nzuru k'eli me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'esio wɛ, nzuru eli me ndɔɔ a Mfam, Mfam hɛ̃ oli me ndɔɔ a nzuru. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nziã wu áseel Mfam, akieel aseel bia-byɛ hɛ̃ me waan e ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ wɛn nzuru a byɛ eli elyam a nzuru a Mãsia? Obobɔ, mɛ̃ èwal elyam e nzuru a Mãsia, me ndɔɔ yi esuul kyɛ ekal elyam e nzuru a ɔ̃kaal nga-esio? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ wɛn mbuul wu obvool nzuru y'ɔ̃kaal nga-esio, oli mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ye ndɛ? Ngwanyã, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã oyɛɛn ndiri: «Bɔ ange-buaal àkal nzuru ngamɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Obɛ 2.24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Kɛn a mbuul wu oyii bvoo ye Mfam oli Ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃ ye ndɛ.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ebal ãndɔɔ m'esio. Obi okyam bueel b'esa mbuul k'oli onse nzuru a ndɛ wɛ. Kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul owi nzuru m'ãndɔɔ m'esio, ndɛ ŋ'asi nzuru a ndyam obi. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Byɛ eyɛɛ yɔ: Nzuru a byɛ eli mboo yi ɔ̃nsensal yi ekal Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, wu oli onse byɛ, wu ewi Nziã byɛ. Byɛ k'ebekal ba byam wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã ásuun byɛ m'ɔ̃bvɛn wa bibi. Obobɔ, elweel Nziã m'ãnzuru ã byɛ.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃mveel ɛ̃ Pool me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ ã bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Me b'otal b'ekel byɛ mɛ̃, ɔ̃mveel ndɛ bu: Me ndɔɔ a bɔɔl, eli ngesɛ kwɛn ndɛ abee obaal. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Kɛn a me ndɔɔ yi abal owɛɛl baal ayesa ãndɔɔ m'esio, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔɔl bwɛn a bɔɔl akal y'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, ɔ̃kaal bwɛn ɔ̃kaal akal y'ɔ̃lam a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔɔl asa ɔ̃kal bɛn ebvaan ndɛ asa ndɛ, ɔ̃kaal hɛ̃ asa bubu m'ɔ̃lam a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ɔ̃kal k'ali y'okwɛn nkal a nzuru a ndyam wɛ, ɔ̃lam mbuul wu oli ye bɔ. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ɔ̃lam k'ali y'okwɛn nkal a nzuru a ndɛ wɛ, ɔ̃kal mbuul wu oli ye bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Ebee bakyɛ nzuru oluo, yɛɛn wɛn okɛɛn byɛ ekuru mfoo wɛn byɛ k'ebvool ntal wɛ me lio etsi-tsiri, me ndɔɔ yi ebuɛɛn. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ebvool ntal onge b'eli tsɔɔn. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, Satana ol'obɔɔ mpwee yi ambio byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eywɛn okwɛn nkal ãnzuru ã byam.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ndɔɔ yi ndieel mɛ̃ ke ngel ngwi byɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ kɛn ãtsam ngwi. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Mɛ̃ ekeedzii wɛn baal bueel akal onge mɛ̃. Kɛn a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul oli ye kab e ndɛ li ewi Nziã me nyiĩ a ndɛ. Wɛn obɔɔ kab lɛn, wɛn hɛ̃ obɔɔ kab likyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Me b'otal amfi y'akaal b'apfiil, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn bɔ wɛn abee obaal onge mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Kɛn okɛɛn bɔ k'akoo k'akal y'ɔ̃kwɛn nkal ãnzuru ã bɔ wɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ abaal. Ke ngwel wɛ, ngesɛ mbuul abaal, ye k'akwa m'efua.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Me b'otal b'amaabaal, mɛ̃ ntam bubu osa, wu otam ke mɛ̃ wɛ, eli Mfam: Yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃kal abee ɔ̃lam obee. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Okɛɛn ndɛ obee ɔ̃lam, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ akal ɔ̃lam pyɛ, wuo abveel bal y'ɔ̃lam. Yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃lam hɛ̃ abee ɔ̃kal obee.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Me b'otal bakyɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn, ke mfam wɛ, eli mɛ̃: Okɛɛn ndoo oli y'ɔ̃kal wɛn k'ali ɔ̃kiool wɛ, wu okiool k'akal ye ndɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ abee ɔ̃kal ondɛ obee. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal oli y'ɔ̃lam wɛn k'ali ɔ̃kiool wɛ, wu okiool k'akal ye ndɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ abee ɔ̃lam obee. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔɔl wɛn k'ali ɔ̃kiool wɛ oli tsotsoo ye Nziã, me ndɔɔ y'ebvɔɔn ndɛ y'ɔ̃kal. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ali ɔ̃kiool wɛ, oli tsotsoo ye Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi ebvɔɔn ndɛ y'ɔ̃lam. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, baan a byɛ k'akaakal tsɛtsɛ wɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ ali tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Kɛn okɛɛn wɛn k'ali ɔ̃kiool wɛ odzii k'abam bal, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ abam lɔ. Me ndɔɔ yi obobɔ, ndoo wu bɔɔl wuo wu ɔ̃kaal oli ndii, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã oti byɛ mbel yi ekal onse opi. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ wu ɔ̃kal, yɛ yɛɛ okɛɛn yɛ akieel abvuul ɔ̃lam? Yɛ wu ɔ̃lam, yɛ yɛɛ okɛɛn yɛ akieel abvuul ɔ̃kal?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzuu m'emfa ki éti Nziã mbel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ndɔɔ nkyam yɛn ebvaan kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal m'emfa ki éyɛɛl Mfam ndɛ, onge b'éli ndɛ ŋ'éti Nziã ndɛ mbel. Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ebeyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn ebvaan baal asa yɔ onse ãbvɔɔn mbueel. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ŋ'éti Nziã yɛ mbel, yɛ ál'amaatsiil yɛ? Yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ bee obii k'akal onge mbuul wɛn k'átsiil wɛ. K'átsiil yɛ wɛ? Yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ bee obii k'akal onge mbuul wu átsiil. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ŋɛn átsiil yɛ k'eli y'otsɛn wɛ, ŋɛn k'átsiil yɛ wɛ, k'eli hɛ̃ y'otsɛn wɛ. Ndɔɔ yi nkiin, osa b'ãndɔɔ m'étam Nziã osa. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal m'emfa ki éli ndɛ ŋ'éti Nziã ndɛ mbel. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ŋ'éti Nziã yɛ mbel, yɛ áli ɔ̃nkyal? Bee nguo okɛɛ me ndɔɔ oyɔ! Okɛɛn yɛ bɔɔ mpwee yi akal mbuul wa ndii, oŋɔ̃ kal m'emfa okyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃nkyal wu éti Mfam mbel oyii mbuul wa ndii wa Mfam. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, mbuul wa ndii wu éti Mfam mbel oyii ɔ̃nkyal a Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Ásuun byɛ m'ɔ̃bvɛn wa bibi. Obobɔ, ebee ankyal a baal okɔɔl. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Andoo, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal ke nkwel a Nziã m'emfa ki éti ndɛ ndɛ mbel.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃mveel ɛ̃ Pool me ndɔɔ amfi y'akaal b'apfiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Me b'otal amfi, Mfam k'atam mɛ̃ ndɔɔ oliaal wɛ, mɛ̃ ewa ãtsam mã mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wɛn akoo k'ata kaã me ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã áti mɛ̃ mbel me nyiĩ a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Oŋɔ̃ etal b'emwɛn mɛ̃ wɛn eli ngesɛ: Me ndɔɔ ãmpal mã lio li, ebvaan kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal m'emfa ki eli ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Yɛ li me bal y'ɔ̃kaal, oŋɔ̃ bee bal olɔ otsal. Yɛ ke li me bal y'ɔ̃kaal wɛ, oŋɔ̃ bee akaal abii. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Kɛn okɛɛn yɛ baal, yɛ k'obi si wɛ. Okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal wa mfi obaal, ndɛ k'asi obi hɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a abaal akieel amwɛn ãmpal, mɛ̃ nzii k'esa kwɛn byɛ ebee mɔ̃ omwɛn.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Andoo, etal m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃: Lio eli li epfi, bɛɛn nonɔ̃, yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli y'ɔ̃kal akal onge mbuul wɛn k'ali ye ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />B'alel akal onge bɛn k'alel wɛ. B'asia mpaa akal onge bɛn k'asia mpal wɛ. B'asuun akal onge bɛn bɔ k'ali y'eluɔ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />B'atwal bvel m'ɔ̃kiri wu, akal onge bɛn bɔ k'atwal lɔ lam wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kiri wu, m'emfa ki eli ndɛ, abwel. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ebee y'ãtsam okal. Mbuul wa mfi akɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ a Mfam: Ndɛ abii emfa ki asa Mfam esɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Kɛn a wu oli y'ɔ̃kal akɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri wu, m'emfa okyɛ ndɛ abebii emfa ki asa ɔ̃kal esɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Obobɔ, ndɛ abekɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ mbuaal. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ɔ̃kaal wa mfi wuo wɛn k'ayɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ, abekɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ ã Mfam. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ abebii k'asa kwɛn nzuru a ndɛ y'ɔ̃fel a ndɛ ekal bvi Mfam. Kɛn ɔ̃kaal a bal abekɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri wu, m'emfa okyɛ ndɛ abebii emfa ki asa ɔ̃lam esɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ obvɛ o byɛ, ke me ndɔɔ yi eywiin byɛ bɛɛ wɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn yɔ kwɛn byɛ esa ãndɔɔ m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ, bvool kwɛn byɛ ewa nzuru yueel m'ɔ̃sal a Mfam.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Kɛn okɛɛn nsam a bɔɔl atsam ndiri ndɛ abee nsam a ɔ̃kaal wu esɔɔn ndɛ obaal, ndɛ ŋ'asi obi, bvool akwa m'efua, bvool atsam ndiri ebvaan bɔ abaal bakyɛ, oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ abaal bakyɛ, onge b'edzii ndɛ. Ndɛ osi ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kɛn a nsam a bɔɔl yi ewɛɛ onse ɔ̃kwal, k'aywɛɛn ndɛ wɛ, ndiri ndɛ k'abaal wɛ, bvool oli y'okwɛn nkal efua e ndɛ, bvool okuru kwɛn ndɛ k'abvool ntal ye nsam a ɔ̃kaal wu esɔɔn ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ osi ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Obobɔ, wu obaal nsam a ɔ̃kaal wu esɔɔn ndɛ, osi ngesɛ, wu obee k'abaal ndɛ, osi ndɔɔ yi enduru obvie.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Ɔ̃kaal oli me bal y'ɔ̃lam me lio lueel li eli bɔɔl kɛn mwiĩ. Kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃lam okwi, ndɛ okoo m'obaal wu edzii ndɛ. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn bɔɔl olɔ akal ɔ̃kiool. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Kɛn a m'ãtsam ã mɛ̃, ndɛ àkal y'esɛ ki enduru, okɛɛn ndɛ okal bubu. Mɛ̃ etsam mpii mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi y'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Anyam b'awi ãkab ol'etiɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Me b'otal tuo li awi mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ, bia-byɛ bueel eyɛɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ, onge b'ebeyɛɛn byɛ. Oyɛɛ obɔ osuul mbuul akal y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, kɛn a dzii ewɛɛl baal. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri ndɛ oyɛɛ ndɔɔ, ŋɛn ndɛ kɛn k'ayɛɛ yɔ m'emfa kyɛn ebvaan ndɛ akaayɛɛ yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Kɛn a wu odzii Nziã, Nziã oyɛɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Obobɔ, me b'otal odza o tuo li awi mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn etiɔ m'ɔ̃kiri pyɛ, bvool eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ngwanyã, baal bakyɛ abeyɛɛn ndiri eli y'anziã ke ywel ye nsie. Eli taa-taa, m'ãtsam ã bɔ, eli y'anziã bibi y'amfam bibi. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ, Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃. Ndɛ wu Taal wu ábuo eluɔ bvieel, bvool wɛn me ndɛ bia-byɛ eli y'omwiĩ. Mfam oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃: Eli Yeso Mãsia, wɛn me nkuul a ndɛ ábuo eluɔ bvieel, bvool wɛn me ndɛ bia-byɛ eli y'omwiĩ.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kɛn a baal bueel k'ali y'oyɛɛ obɔ wɛ. Bakyɛ tiil meba ali y'epfuũ ki abebuɛɛn etiɔ. Ŋ'ebedza bɔ tuo li awi mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ, bɔ abekiool ndiri eli mpɔɔ yam yi awi ol'etiɔ obvɛ. Onge bɛn bɔ kɛn awam onse ãndɔɔ ã Nziã wɛ, bɔ abetsam ndiri bɔ ali ye mbiin me ndɔɔ anyam obɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, bvi-odza k'esiaal bia-byɛ tsotsoo ye Nziã wɛ: Ŋɛn bia-byɛ k'edzi bvɛ wɛ, bia-byɛ ki eywɛn pyɛ, ŋɛn bia-byɛ edzi bvɛ, bia-byɛ ki ebɔɔ hɛ̃ pyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ekal y'onkyab! K'ebvaan kwɛn mɛn byɛ ekoo k'esa ãbal akiool bɛn kɛn awam wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ wa y'oyɛɛ, ŋɛn mbuul wɛn kɛn awam onse ãndɔɔ ã Nziã wɛ omwɛn yɛ adza onse nzɔ yi abuɛɛn etiɔ, ol'esɛn bwɛn? Ol'esi kwɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ atɔ k'odza o tuo li awi mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Obobɔ, me ndɔɔ oyɛɛ o yɛ, ɔ̃kiool wɛn kɛn awam wɛ àbva, ndɛ wu ndoo wu ékwi Mãsia me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ŋ'esi byɛ andoo obi m'emfa okyɛ, bvool etɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ bɛn kɛn awam wɛ, byɛ ŋ'esi obi ke nkwel a Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn okɛɛn bvi-odza ebal ndoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'edza tuo bam wɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee k'ebal ndoo a mɛ̃.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Pool atsweel ontam o ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke ndi ndii wɛ? Mɛ̃ ke ntam ndi wɛ? Mɛ̃ k'émwɛn Yeso wu Mfam a bia-byɛ wɛ? Byɛ ŋ'eyii obobɔ, ke m'ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Mfam wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Okɛɛn bakyɛ abetsam ndiri mɛ̃ ke ndi ntam wɛ, me ndɔɔ a byɛ, mɛ̃ ndi ntam. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eli eliĩ eki esuo ontam o mɛ̃ onse Mfam. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Wu ɔ̃mveel a mɛ̃ ola b'apfiɔɔl mɛ̃: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />K'awi bee nkuul yi edza ye yi enywã wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />K'awi bee nkuul yi ebiri nkyel ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kiool onge ɔ̃kal, onge b'ebesa antam bakyɛ, y'andoo a Mfam, ye Sefas wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Eli kɛn a mɛ̃ ye Balanabas bɛn ebvaan esal? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Mbuul nã wu abesa ɔ̃sal wu ombwel-mbwel me nzi e ndyam? Wu abekwɛn bvine nã, wɛn k'abedza nsia e lɔ wɛ? Wu abuaal anyam nã, wɛn k'anywã ãbiaal ã bɔ wɛ?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn obobɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki ombuul? Ngel wɛn k'eyɛɛn obobɔ wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ngwanyã, ákel onse Ngel a Moyize bubu: «Ŋ'esal ngwɛmbɛ me lio li aka eluɔ, bee ndɛ ɔ̃nywã okuru<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Det 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ti 5.18</ref></char></note>.» Nziã abekɛɛ angwɛmbɛ nguo? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ke yam, ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, ke me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ wɛ? Ngwanyã, ákel obobɔ me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn wu asal, asal ye kaã. Wu asal me lio li aka bele ebvaan akal ye kaã li abɔɔ boo li ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Bee ekwɛn ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ m'Ɔ̃fel onse byɛ. Okɛɛn bee ebɔɔ ebvakab ki opfel bɛn ke b'ɔ̃fel wɛ ola byɛ, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Okɛɛn bakyɛ akoo k'abɔɔ eluɔ ola byɛ, bɛn bee k'ekoo k'ebɔɔ bvam bvi enduru wɛ? Kɛn a bee k'ewel eluɔ obvɛ bvɛn ebvaan bee ekeewal wɛ. Bee ekuru mwiĩ me mbueel, me ndɔɔ yi ebee Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia okii. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />B'asa ɔ̃sal onse Nzɔ a Nziã, yi eliil bɔ Nzɔ a Nziã yiyi. B'asal ke nkiin yi awa Nziã ãmpɔɔ, abɔɔ boo li bɔ li ãmpɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, Mfam owi ngel ndiri b'atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ akal mpɛn me Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke mbɔɔ eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ kyɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ ekeebɔɔ wɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke nswɛn ɔ̃kaan wu me ndɔɔ yi ebii kwɛn awa mɛ̃ eluɔ obvɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ngesɛ me nkwa, ke mboo a k'ewa mɛ̃ nkuul kwɛn ambaal dzuun e mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ke yam, otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ k'eli ndɔɔ yi esa mɛ̃ nzal-a-nsia wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ eli ndɔɔ yɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ esa. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke nsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ, olɔ fool li bwɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Okɛɛn myam wu esueel k'esa ɔ̃sal wu otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ ondɛ, mɛ̃ ekeebɔɔ furu. Kɛn onge bɛn yɔ ke ndɔɔ yi ewɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ ebiri kɛn a pfuũ li atam mɛ̃ obiri. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Obobɔ, furu e mɛ̃ emã? Furu e mɛ̃ eli li etsal mɛ̃ Nsia Ngesɛ ngwel. Mɛ̃ k'ebɔɔ eluɔ kyɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ ekeebɔɔ me Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool okiool k'akal ɔ̃nkyal a baal bueel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ ndi ndii ke nkwel a baal bueel, mɛ̃ nkiool k'ekal ɔ̃nkyal a baal bueel, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ baal b'anduru olɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ŋ'ekekal mɛ̃ y'Ayuda, mɛ̃ ekekal onge Ɔ̃yuda, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ Ayuda. Ŋ'ekekal mɛ̃ ye b'ali ke nsɛn a Ngel, mɛ̃ ekekal onge wu oli ke nsɛn a Ngel, kwɛn ŋɛn myam ke ndi ke nsɛn a Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Ŋ'ekekal mɛ̃ ye b'aywɛn a Ngel, mɛ̃ ekekal onge wu oywɛn a Ngel, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ b'aywɛn a Ngel, kwɛn ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ngywɛn a Ngel a Nziã wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebekiaal Ngel a Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Ŋ'ekekal mɛ̃ ye baal bɛn kɛn awam onse okiool wɛ, mɛ̃ ekekal onge bɔ, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbiri bɔ ola Mãsia. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ nsi mbueel me ndɔɔ a baal bueel, kwɛn mɛ̃ mvuul baal ke kwɛ m'emfa kieel. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Mɛ̃ ebesa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel, me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ boo li Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ mɛn b'atsuu ntiin abvaan asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ke mbaa yi abesa ɛ̃taan, b'abetsuu ntiin abetsuu yɔ bɔ bueel, kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ abebɔɔ ebva-kab. Obobɔ, etsuu ntiin m'emfa kyɛn byɛ ebɔɔ ebva-kab. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Baal bueel b'abetsuu ntiin abebee eluɔ bibi. Bɔ abesa obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi abɔɔ ekɔrɔ ki abewa wu obvel, kyɛn k'eyiil k'ofool wɛ. Kɛn a bia-byɛ ebesa obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi ebɔɔ ekɔrɔ ki abewa wu obvel, kyɛn k'efool bam wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ k'etsuu ntiin epwa wɛ. Ŋ'ekii mɛ̃ ɛ̃nkwaã, mɛ̃ k'ekii myɛ̃ kii-a-kii wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ebetuaal nzuru mpal, mɛ̃ ndi y'okwɛn nkal a yɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn, ke mbee a ŋe ntee-ntee mɛ̃ bakyɛ, abee mɛ̃ me pyɛ osuul.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ãnkunkwa me ndɔɔ obuɛɛn b'etiɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ebee ndɔɔ yi odzɛɛn: Ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ bueel áli ke nsɛn ebwii, bɔ bueel átsiil ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:13-21">Opa 13.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:19-29">14.19-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bɔ bueel áwel opongo o Moyize, onse ebwii bvool onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bɔ bueel ádzi bvi-odza abvi-bvi bvi ɔ̃fel, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />bvool bɔ bueel ánywi ãdza amamã m'ɔ̃fel. Ngwanyã, bɔ ánywi ãdza ke nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃fel yi ékedzuu ye bɔ, nkɔɔn oyɔ éli Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Kɛn a bibi onse bɔ k'ási Nziã esɛ wɛ, obɔ otsɛn bɛn ebiĩ e bɔ elaal abɔ-bɔɔ onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:16">Ɛ̃bv 14.16</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãsuo bia-byɛ emfa ki edzuu. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ kieel k'ekal y'efua bvi ebi-ebi wɛ, onge bvi éli y'ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Byɛ ebee etiɔ obuɛɛn onge b'ési bakyɛ onse bɔ. Ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Baal abvi nsɛn me ndɔɔ yi adza, bvool anywã, bu atɛɛn m'osa b'ɛ̃taan<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Opa 32.6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Bia-byɛ ebee nzuru m'ãndɔɔ m'esio owa onge b'éwi bakyɛ onse bɔ, bu ákwi amiil ãku-mbuaal y'atyel (23.000) tsoo ngelemɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Ɛ̃bv 25.1-18</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Ebee Mãsia okie onge b'ési bakyɛ onse bɔ, antaal bu abam bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Ebee oŋwaã onge b'éŋwaã bakyɛ onse bɔ. Ãnzwel m'ãkebaan baal ãbam bɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2">Ɛ̃bv 14.2</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:6-14">17.6-14</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ã́yi onse bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi esuo bia-byɛ emfa ki edzuu. Ákel mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi ãwa bia-byɛ ãnkunkwa, bia-byɛ b'eyii ke lio li ntɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn wu atsam ndiri ndɛ oli tɛ, akal y'onkyab kwɛn ndɛ abee obva. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ɛ̃mbio mvieel mi ɛ̃yi onse byɛ ɛ̃li mi ɛ̃beya onse baal bueel. Nziã oli wu obvaan m'okiool: Ndɛ k'àwa nkuul kwɛn ombio b'ambio byɛ obvel byɛ mpɛn wɛ. Me lio li ɔ̃mbio, ndɛ àwa byɛ mpɛn yi ekuru ɔ̃kwal bvool àsuo byɛ nkuul yi epal onse ndɛ.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bvoo y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi pyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Obobɔ, andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ebee etiɔ obuɛɛn. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye byɛ onge b'ayɛɛn ye baal b'ãyal. Oŋɔ̃ byam ebwɛɛl m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ ngesɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Emeetsam me ndɔɔ a mbiɔ yi ɔ̃laan a Mfam yi ebebveel bia-byɛ Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a yɔ: Ŋ'ebenywã bia-yɛ yɔ, yɔ k'ebebvool bia-byɛ y'ãkel ã Mãsia wɛ? Mampa wu ebekab bia-byɛ: Ŋ'ebedza bia-byɛ ndɛ, ndɛ k'abebvool bia-byɛ ye nzuru a Mãsia wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Mampa oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ b'eli bibi eli nzuru ngamɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ ebekab mampa ngɔmɔ̃.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Emeetsam me ndɔɔ a baal b'Isalayel: B'abedza ãtuo b'abewa Nziã ãmpɔɔ nkal a nkiin ali me bvoo ye Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃ ŋe ngyɛɛn wɛn nki? Tuo li awi mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ oli ye dzuun? Etiɔ eli ye dzuun? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, bvi awa mpɔɔ, akab bvɛ ol'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, k'ola Nziã wɛ. Mɛ̃ ke nzii kwɛn byɛ ekal ye bvoo y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Byɛ k'ekoo m'onywã mbiɔ a Mfam, bvool enywã mbiɔ a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi wɛ. Byɛ hɛ̃ k'ekoo m'odza ke misa a Mfam bvool edza hɛ̃ ke misa a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Wuo bia-byɛ edzii k'epwee Mfam? Bia-byɛ enduru Mfam mpɛn?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa o mbueel me ndɔɔ yi alweel Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />«Awi nkuul yi asa mbueel.» Ngwanyã, kɛn a mbueel k'ãli ngesɛ wɛ. «Awi mɛ̃ nkuul yi esa mbueel», kɛn a mbueel k'ãwɛɛl baal wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ abee kɛn obvɛ o ndyam obii, abii bo bakyɛ!<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Edza bvieel bvi atiɔ ke yu, ebee ofuul wɛn bvɛ kwɛn efi, kwɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃bee obii. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri: «Nsie ye bvieel bvi onse yɔ, eli bvi Mfam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Ãnz 24.1</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ŋɛn mbuul wɛn k'ɔ̃kiool wɛ oti byɛ mbel yi odza, byɛ eyi okɔ, edza bvieel bvi ebuun ndɛ byɛ. Ebee ɔ̃mfuul si ngɔmɔ̃ ofuul wɛn bvi-odza bvi kwɛn efi, kwɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃bee obii. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul olieel byɛ ndiri: «Tuo olɔ, awi lɔ mpɔɔ ol'etiɔ», ebee lɔ odza, me ndɔɔ a wu owi byɛ nsia oyɔ, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃bee ɛ̃bii. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn «me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃bee obii», mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. Otsɛn omã bɛn ãtsam m'ɔ̃kwal a mbuul ɔ̃kyam ãkoo k'ãluo mɛ̃ k'esa benzii mɛ̃? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ki edza mɛ̃, otsɛn omã bɛn ol'apfiɔɔl mɛ̃ bvool me bvɛn mɛ̃ bam emeebveel ãtuɛɛn? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />M'emfa okyɛ, ekal ŋ'edza byɛ, ekal ŋ'enywã byɛ, wuo ŋ'esa byɛ ndɔɔ yueel, esa yɔ me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Ebee mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ obal m'obi: Ekal Ayuda, ekal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ekal Ebvɔɔn e Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Esa onge b'ebesa mɛ̃: M'ãndɔɔ mbueel, mɛ̃ ebesa mpɛn yi ewa mbuul wueel esɛ. Mɛ̃ k'ebii obvɛ o myam wɛ, mɛ̃ ebebii obvɛ b'ɔ̃bobɔ a baal, kwɛn bɔ abvuul.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Enɔɔn nkuul e mɛ̃, onge b'ebenɔɔn mɛ̃ nkuul e Mãsia.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akaal bwɛn abɔɔl ke nkwel a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Mɛ̃ etuɛɛn byɛ me ndɔɔ yi ebetsam byɛ mɛ̃ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, byɛ hɛ̃ ebesa mbueel m'emfa ki ntam mɛ̃ byɛ osa. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ bubu: Mãsia oli Mfam a bɔɔl lueel. Ɔ̃lam oli mfam a ɔ̃kal a ndɛ. Nziã oli Mfam a Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Bɔɔl lueel li ebuɛɛn wuo li eyɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã ɔ̃tswɛ m'ofoo, awa Mfam a ndɛ opfuru. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kɛn ɔ̃kaal wueel wu abuɛɛn wuo wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã ɔ̃tswɛ kal, awa ɔ̃lam a ndɛ opfuru. Ndɛ oli onge ɔ̃kaal wu akie ɔ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal k'afoo ɔ̃tswɛ wɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ atsɔɔ mfu hɛ̃! Okɛɛn eli ndɔɔ yi opfuru me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kaal k'atsɔɔ wuo k'akie mfu, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ afoo ɔ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Bɔɔl k'ebvaan afoo ɔ̃tswɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli emfa bvool oli lweel e Nziã, kɛn ɔ̃kaal oli lweel li ɔ̃lam. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'ási bɔɔl m'ɔ̃kaal wɛ, ndɛ ási ɔ̃kaal me bɔɔl. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Nziã k'ási bɔɔl me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kaal wɛ, ndɛ ási ɔ̃kaal me ndɔɔ a bɔɔl. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, me ndɔɔ ãnzwel, ɔ̃kaal ebvaan afoo ɔ̃tswɛ. Okyɛ eliĩ ki esuo omfam b'eli ndɛ ke nsɛn a bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ke yam, ke nkwel a Mfam, ɔ̃kaal k'akoo m'okal wɛ, okɛɛn bɔɔl pyɛ, bɔɔl hɛ̃ k'akoo m'okal wɛ, okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal pyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn Nziã ábuo ɔ̃kaal me bɔɔl, emfa kiki hɛ̃, wu abeburu bɔɔl eli ɔ̃kaal. Kɛn a bɔ bueel afi ola Nziã.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Byam oŋɔ̃ ebwɛɛl m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ ngesɛ: Eli ngesɛ kwɛn ɔ̃kaal abuɛɛn Nziã ɔ̃tswɛ kal? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />K'ɔ̃kiri ndyam k'asuo byɛ kwɛn eli ndɔɔ yi opfuru me bɔɔl k'akal ye mfu yi nda wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Kɛn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kaal, eli ndɔɔ yi dzuun kwɛn ndɛ akal ye mfu yi nda. Ke ngwel wɛ, áwi ɔ̃kaal mfu yi nda kwɛn yɔ ekal onge etambal ki ela. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'ata enkyam me ndɔɔ oyɔ, ebvaan ndɛ ayɛɛ kwɛn bee k'eli y'epfuũ okyɛ wɛ, ãbvɔɔn ã Nziã hɛ̃ k'ãli ye kyɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃laan a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Me b'otal ãndɔɔ me nzii k'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ bvool, mɛ̃ k'etuɛɛn byɛ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn byɛ ŋ'ebebvɔɔn byɛ, obvɔɔn o byɛ k'obebiri byɛ ke ndɔɔ yi enduru obvie wɛ, bɔ obebiri byɛ kɛn a ke ndɔɔ yi enduru obii. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, mɛ̃ ngyoo ndiri, ŋ'ebebvɔɔn byɛ onse Ebvɔɔn, okab obekal onse byɛ. Mɛ̃ nkiool ndɔɔ oyɔ etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ke yam, ebvaan kwɛn okab okal onse byɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, akiool b'asɛn ãnã onse ɔ̃mbio ondɛ amɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn, obvɔɔn b'ebebvɔɔn byɛ, k'oli me ndɔɔ yi edza ɔ̃laan a Mfam wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me lio li edza byɛ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul abedzuul k'adza bvi-odza e ndyam. M'emfa okyɛ, bakyɛ akɛɛn me nzal, kwɛn ŋɛn bakyɛ mbal ãbɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Byɛ k'eli y'ãnzɔ kwɛn byɛ eyedza wuo eyenywã wɛ? Wuo, byɛ ebesa obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi epfiɔɔl Ebvɔɔn e Nziã, bvool ewa bɛn eluɔ pyɛ opfuru? Mɛ̃ byɛ omã eyɛɛn? Ntuɛɛn byɛ? Me ndɔɔ yi, mɛ̃ k'etuɛɛn byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, etal m'ébɔɔ mɛ̃ ola Mfam, bu nkaal byɛ mɔ̃: Mfam Yeso, me tsia wu átiɔ ndɛ, áwel mampa. <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ebveel ndɛ Nziã ãtuɛɛn, otsiil mampa ondɛ, bu alieel bubu: «Yi bu eli nzuru a mɛ̃, yɔ eli yi byɛ. Ebesa obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi etsam mɛ̃.» <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ke mbee odza, Mfam owel bvool mbiɔ a mbal ã bvine, bu alieel ndiri: «Mbiɔ yi eli ondoo b'alili b'atɛn m'ãkel ã mɛ̃. Esa obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi etsam mɛ̃, lio lueeel li enywã mɔ̃.» <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ke ngwel wɛ, lio lueel li èdza byɛ mampa wu bvool ènywã mbiɔ yi, byɛ ŋ'ebetsal nsia epfu e Mfam, tiil ye k'èya ndɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn wu adza mampa wuo anywã mbiɔ a Mfam m'emfa kyɛn k'ebvaan wɛ, ndɛ abɔɔ etsob me ndɔɔ a nzuru y'ãkel ã Mfam. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ametsam ngesɛ emfa ki ekal ndɛ, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'edza ndɛ mampa bvool anywã mbiɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu adza mampa bvool anywã mbiɔ oyɔ, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ k'ayɛɛ otsɛn o nzuru a Mfam wɛ, ŋ'awi nzuru a ndyam etumbu. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn eli ye baal ba y'ãluu ye ba y'elyam bibi onse byɛ, baal bibi hɛ̃ akwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ etal epfuũ e bia-byam ngesɛ, Nziã k'awa bia-byɛ etumbu wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ke yam, Mfam abeyiaan bia-byɛ me ndɔɔ yi abveel bia-byɛ me nkuul. Kwɛn bia-byɛ ebee etumbu obɔɔ mboo mɔ̃ y'ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Obobɔ, andoo, ŋ'ebvɔɔn byɛ me ndɔɔ yi edza ɔ̃laan a Mfam, ekiaal bakyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Okɛɛn mbuul oli ye nzal, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ adza ke nzɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ebvɔɔn byɛ, Nziã k'awa byɛ etumbu wɛ. Me b'otal ãndɔɔ m'ãsiil, mɛ̃ èsoo mɔ̃, ŋ'ekieel eya mɛ̃.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ãkab m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Andoo, me ndɔɔ yi etal ãkab m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, mɛ̃ k'edzii kwɛn byɛ ekal onse odzɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ŋ'éli byɛ tsɔɔn Nziã oyɛɛ wɛ, byɛ ekeyɔɔl kwɛn ábiri byɛ ol'anziã ba mfya bɛn k'ayɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bam wɛn, mbuul wu adzuu m'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã k'akoo k'ayɛɛn wɛ ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn abwel Yeso enkɛɛ!» Okɛɛn hɛ̃ mbuul k'adzuu m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo m'oyɛɛn wɛ ndiri: «Yeso oli Mfam.»<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Ãkab ã nyiĩ a Nziã ãli bibi, kɛn Ɔ̃fel oli ndɛ wuwu. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ɛ̃sal ɛ̃li m'emfa-m'emfa, kɛn Mfam oli ndɛ wuwu. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Emfa bvi asa ɔ̃sal a Mfam eli bibi, kɛn a Nziã oli ndɛ wuwu, ndɛ oli wu abesa ndɔɔ yueel onse baal bueel. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, me kab li eyɔɔ mbuul bwɛn a mbuul, Ɔ̃fel abesal onse ndɛ me ndɔɔ obvɛ o baal bueel. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ola mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel owi kab li ayɛɛn y'ɔ̃nyiã. Ola mbuul wumɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel wuwu owi kab li ayɛɛn y'oyɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Ɔ̃fel wuwu hɛ̃ owi ola mbuul ɔ̃kyam kab li okiool, ola mbuul wukyɛ, Ɔ̃fel wuwu owi kab li aboo anga-ãluu. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Ola mbuul wukyɛ, Ɔ̃fel owi mpɛn yi asa emvieel, ola wumɔ̃ ndɛ owi kab li aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, ola wukyɛ bvool, ndɛ owi kab li ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ol'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, ye mɛn k'ãfa ola ndɛ wɛ. Ola wukyɛ, ndɛ owi kab li ayɛɛn m'ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam, ola mbuul bvool wukyɛ, ndɛ owi kab li akaal ɛ̃nywã omyɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Kɛn Ɔ̃fel oli ndɛ ngɔmɔ̃ bvool oli ndɛ wuwu. Ndɛ wu asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, wu akab mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa ki ewɛɛ ndɛ.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuru ngamɔ̃, elyam bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn nzuru eli ngamɔ̃, kɛn a yɔ eli m'elyam bibi, bvool onkyam ŋɛn bvɛ eli bibi, bvɛ bvieel ebuo kɛn a nzuru ngamɔ̃. Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ a Mãsia. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ekal Ayuda, ekal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ekal ankyal, ekal bɛn k'ankyal wɛ, bia-byɛ bueel éwel opongo b'Ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi ebuo nzuru ngamɔ̃. Bia-byɛ bueel hɛ̃ énywi ãdza m'Ɔ̃fel wuwu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Obobɔ, nzuru k'eli kɛn a m'elyam ngemɔ̃ wɛ, yɔ eli m'elyam bibi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Okɛɛn kuul ebvi oliaal ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi kuɔɔl wɛ, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi elyam e nzuru wɛ», kyɛ olɔ ekwɛɛn k'ekal elyam e nzuru me ndɔɔ yi elieel kyɛ obobɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Okɛɛn hɛ̃ tswi ebvi oliaal ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi dziil wɛ, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi elyam e nzuru wɛ», lɔ olɔ ekwɛɛn k'ekal elyam e nzuru me ndɔɔ yi elieel lɔ obobɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />K'okɛɛn nzuru yueel eli kɛn a dziil etu, yɔ bwɛn a bwɛn ekeeyoo? Okɛɛn yɔ eli kɛn a tswi etu, yɔ nswel bwɛn ekeeyɔɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ke yam, Nziã osuul elyam bwɛn elyam me nzuru, m'emfa ki edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Okɛɛn elyam e nzuru bvieel eli kɛn a elyam ngemɔ̃, nzuru kwɛn ekeekal? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Obobɔ, elyam eli bibi, kɛn a nzuru eli ngamɔ̃.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Ŋɛn dziil k'ekoo m'oliaal kuɔɔl wɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi ye kɔɔ e yɛ wɛ!» Ɔ̃tswɛ hɛ̃ k'akoo m'oliaal ɛ̃mpal wɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi ye kɔɔ e byɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, elyam e nzuru bvi eli onge bvɛn otsɛn pyɛ, eli y'otsɛn bibi. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Bvi emeewal bia-byɛ onge bvɛn dzuun pyɛ me nzuru, bia-byɛ ebewa bvɛ dzuun bibi. Obobɔ, elyam bvɛn k'ebvaan amwɛn wɛ, bia-byɛ ebefaal bvɛ bam nzyal-nzyal. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Elyam e nzuru bvɛn akoo m'omwɛn, k'eli ye kɔɔ kwɛn afaal bvɛ wɛ. Kɛn a Nziã ási nzuru me ndɔɔ yi awa elyam bvɛn k'eli y'otsɛn wɛ dzuun bibi. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />M'emfa okyɛ, nzuru k'eli y'okab wɛ, kɛn elyam bvieel ebewuaal a bvikyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Okɛɛn elyam e nzuru ngemɔ̃ eluu, bvi esiil eluu ye kyɛ, okɛɛn awi elyam e nzuru ngemɔ̃ dzuun, bvi esiil esia mpaa ye kyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Byɛ bam eli nzuru a Mãsia, bvool mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse byɛ oli elyam e nzuru oyɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />M'emfa okyɛ, onse Ebvɔɔn, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, Nziã osuul antam, li mbuaal, ndɛ osuul aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn, li atyel, ndɛ osuul ayiool. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ hɛ̃ osuul ba y'ãkab m'asa emvieel, m'aboo anga-ãluu, m'awuaal a bakyɛ, m'abiri baal, ye m'ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Bɔ bueel antam ali? Bɔ bueel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ali? Bɔ bueel ayiool ali? Bɔ bueel asa b'emvieel ali? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Bɔ bueel aboo b'anga-ãluu ali? Bɔ bueel b'abeyɛɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam ali? Bɔ bueel b'abekaal ɛ̃nywã omyɛ̃ ali? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ekal y'efua ki ekal y'ãkab m'ãnduru ɔ̃bvɛn. M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ esuo byɛ nkuul yi enduru opal.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Dzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Mɛ̃ nkoo k'eyɛɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ baal ye mi ãnzwel. Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi ye dzii wɛ, mɛ̃ ŋe ndi kɛn a bvieel li ebel wuo ãnzenza m'ãsa nkyal. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Mɛ̃ nkoo k'eliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, mɛ̃ nkoo k'ekwaal otsɛn o mbueel m'ãli m'edziɔɔn, bvool ndi y'oyɛɛ bam bueel. Mɛ̃ nkoo k'ekal y'okiool b'esa kwɛn ãnkio ãmbal k'ãmboo ã mɔ̃, ãyi k'ãmboo ãnkyam. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi ye dzii wɛ, mɛ̃ kɛn a mbuul wa ngwel ndi ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Mɛ̃ nkoo k'ekab opfel o mɛ̃ ola baal bueel ba ye nzal, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nkoo k'ewa nzuru a mɛ̃ kwɛn atsoo yɔ mbaa. Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi ye dzii wɛ, mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃ ki ebɔɔ pyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Mbuul wu adzii oli y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal, bvool abewuaal a baal. Ndɛ k'ayoo mbuul ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ wɛ, ndɛ k'ali ye nzal-a-nsia wɛ, ndɛ k'ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Mbuul wa ye dzii k'asa ndɔɔ yi opfuru wɛ, ndɛ k'abii kɛn obvɛ o ndyam wɛ, ndɛ k'aya mpuru wɛ, ndɛ k'awal mbuul ɔ̃lyɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Ndɛ k'asia-mpaa me ndɔɔ yi mbi wɛ, ndɛ asia-mpaa me ndɔɔ yi taa-taa. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Mbuul wa ye dzii abedzeel mbueel, ndɛ akiool mbueel, ndɛ abeta kaã m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, ndɛ oli y'osɛ-mwiĩ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Dzii k'ebefa bam wɛ. Ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã kieel ɛ̃fa mfel, kab li ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam ekieel efa mfel, li oyɛɛ hɛ̃ ekieel efa mfel. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ k'eyɛɛ m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo wɛ, bia-byɛ k'ebeyɔɔ ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Kɛn a ŋ'ekieel ekal mbueel ɔ̃koo, kyɛn k'eli ɔ̃koo wɛ ekieel efa mfel.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ŋ'éli mɛ̃ ndyam kɛn ɔ̃bwee, mɛ̃ ékeyɛɛn onge muaan wu ɔ̃bwee, mɛ̃ éketsam onge muaan wu ɔ̃bwee, mɛ̃ éli y'ãyal mɛn onge mã muaan wu ɔ̃bwee. Ŋe ngyel mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyiri mbueel m'ãli mã baan b'abwee. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Nonɔ̃, bia-byɛ ebemwɛn onge b'amwɛn ongwel etɛɛl, k'emwɛn ngesɛ wɛ. Kɛn a bia-byɛ ekieel emwɛn nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃. Nonɔ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ekieel eyɛɛ m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo onge b'eyɛɛ Nziã mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Meba ãndɔɔ anga-ãtyel mã ãli: Okiool, kaã, ye dzii. Kɛn a ndɔɔ yi enduru okuun onse mɔ̃, dzii.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kab li oyɛɛn b'ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã ye li oyɛɛn b'ɛ̃nywã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn ebii k'ekal ye dzii. Ekal y'efua ki bibi me ndɔɔ ãkab m'Ɔ̃fel, bvel-bvel kab li aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'eyɛɛn mbuul wa ye kab li ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã, ndɛ ke ye baal abeyɛɛn wɛ, ndɛ ye Nziã abeyɛɛn. Mbuul k'akwaal m'eyɛɛn ndɛ otsɛn wɛ. Me waan li Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, ndɛ ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã m'edziɔɔn. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kɛn a mbuul wu aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, ye baal abeyɛɛn: Ndɛ abvool baal, awa bɔ mpɛn, bvool abweel bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã awɛɛl okiool o ndyam, kɛn a wu aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã awɛɛl Ebvɔɔn.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Mɛ̃ nzii bam kwɛn byɛ bueel eyɛɛn ɛ̃nywã, kɛn a bvel-bvel mɛ̃ nzii bam kwɛn byɛ aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã. Wu aliaal ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã onduru wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã, yɛɛn wɛn nsɔɔ̃ wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã akaal myɛ̃, kwɛn Ebvɔɔn ewam. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Andoo, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ngyi ola byɛ, bu mvi ɛ̃nywã oyɛɛn. Ŋɛn ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ k'ãsa byɛ ndɔɔ wɛ, k'ãyɛɛl byɛ ndɔɔ wɛ, k'ãwa byɛ oyɛɛ wɛ, k'ãliaal byɛ ɔ̃kiɛɛn wu ofi ola Nziã wɛ, k'ãyiool byɛ ndɔɔ wɛ, mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃ ŋe ngueel a byɛ?<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ eluɔ bvi asio mpaa onge nsiɛɛn wuo nguɔ̃. Okɛɛn ɔ̃kam k'ali mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a nkii a eluɔ obvɛ wɛ, obobɔ ayɛɛ bwɛn a bwɛn wɛn yi nkii a nsiɛɛn, yi ye nguɔ̃? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Okɛɛn nkii a mvel-a-mvel k'eli kal-a-kal wɛ, wu awal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ayedzwaan mvel nã? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, okɛɛn m'ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ byɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛn ndɔɔ yi y'otsɛn wɛ, ayɛɛ m'eyɛɛn byɛ bwɛn? M'emfa okyɛ, ãyɛɛn ã byɛ ãkal mã ngwel! <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃li bibi m'ɔ̃kiri, bvool onse myɛ̃ wu oywɛn a otsɛn pyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ k'eyoo ɔ̃nywã a mbuul wu ayɛɛn ye mɛ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ olɔ ngyii onge ɔ̃nzii ke nkwel a ndɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ ol'oyii onge ɔ̃nzii ke nkwel a mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Eli emfa kiki hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Onge bɛn byɛ ebebii ãkab m'Ɔ̃fel, ebii mɔ̃ bvool bibi, kɛn ebvaan ekal me ndɔɔ yi esa kwɛn Ebvɔɔn ewam.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã, abuɛɛn kwɛn Nziã awa ndɛ kab li akaal myɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ebuɛɛn mɛ̃ m'ɛ̃nywã, ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃ oli onse ãbuɛɛn, kɛn ãyal a mɛ̃ k'ãsal wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Oŋɔ̃ esa bwɛn? Mɛ̃ èbuɛɛn m'Ɔ̃fel, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èbuɛɛn y'ãyal. Mɛ̃ èyam m'Ɔ̃fel, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èyam y'ãyal. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Okɛɛn yɛ abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn kɛn a m'ɔ̃fel, emfa emã kyɛn bɛn k'akwaal otsɛn wɛ ol'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Amɛn!» M'ebuɛɛn e yɛ? Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'ayɛɛ m'eyɛɛn yɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ngwanyã, ebuɛɛn olɔ eli ngesɛ, kɛn a lɔ k'ewɛɛl bakyɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Mɛ̃ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ nduru byɛ bueel m'oyɛɛn b'ɛ̃nywã. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Kɛn onse ebvɔɔn, mɛ̃ ebedzii k'eliaal ãyɛɛn ãtaan mã y'otsɛn me ndɔɔ yi ewa bakyɛ ãyal, ke mboo a k'eliaal mɛ̃ ãyɛɛn amiil kuun (10.000) m'ɛ̃nywã.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Andoo, ebee onge baan b'abwee okal m'emfa ki etaal byɛ ãndɔɔ. Me b'otal obi, ekal onge baan b'abwee. Kɛn a me b'otal otaal b'ãndɔɔ, ekal onge akuul. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel onse Ngel a Moyize bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">«Mfam olieel bubu: “Mɛ̃ ekieel eyɛɛn ye yam li me nkuul baal b'ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃kyam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Mɛ̃ ekieel eyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ɛ̃nywã mi anzii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Onkyam obobɔ, bɔ kieel k'ayoo mɛ̃ wɛ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:49">Det 28.49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Edz 28.11-12</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />M'emfa okyɛ, oyɛɛn b'ɛ̃nywã oli eliĩ me ndɔɔ a baal bɛn k'akiool wɛ, ke me ndɔɔ akiool wɛ. Kɛn oyɛɛn b'ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã oli eliĩ me ndɔɔ akiool, ke me ndɔɔ a bɛn k'akiool wɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Emeeta mboo yi: Ŋɛn Ebvɔɔn kieel ebvɔɔn, akiool bueel bu abvi ɛ̃nywã oyɛɛn. Ŋɛn akiool bɛn k'ayɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ, wuo baal bɛn k'akiool wɛ, apal oŋɔ̃, bɔ mpii ol'abvi otsam ndiri byɛ eli y'owool! <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Kɛn okɛɛn bueel ayɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, mbuul wɛn k'ɔ̃kiool wɛ, wuo ɔ̃kiool wɛn k'ayɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ aya oŋɔ̃, m'eyoo ndɛ ãsuo ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ oli mbuul nga-ãbi, bvool ndɛ akyɛɛl nzuru me ndɔɔ a mbueel m'eyoo ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Ãndɔɔ mã m'edziɔɔn onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ ãmɔɔn. Obobɔ, ndɛ abva ãbuo mbwii me nsie, alweel Nziã ndiri: «Ngwanyã, Nziã oli onse byɛ!»<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃tswab onse Ebvɔɔn pyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Andoo, oŋɔ̃ esa bwɛn? Ŋ'ebvɔɔn byɛ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ okoo k'ayam, wumɔ̃ okoo k'ayiool, wumɔ̃ bvool okoo k'ayɛɛl ndɔɔ, wumɔ̃ bvool okoo k'ayɛɛn ndɔɔ m'ɛ̃nywã, wumɔ̃ hɛ̃ okoo k'akaal yɔ. Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn omɔ̃ mbueel ãsa kwɛn Ebvɔɔn ewam. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Okɛɛn baal ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã, yɔɔl kwɛn ekal ye baal buaal, ŋ'enduru bɔ olɔɔ atyel. Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn bɔ ayɛɛn m'ɔ̃mɔ̃ ɔ̃mɔ̃, bvool ebvaan ekal ye mbuul wu akaal. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Okɛɛn wu akaal pyɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ akal pi onse Ebvɔɔn, wu ayɛɛn, ayɛɛn ye ndyam bvool ye Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Me b'otal baal b'ayɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, yɔɔl kwɛn ekal baal buaal wuo atyel, bakyɛ abwɛɛl m'eyɛɛn bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Okɛɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam oli y'ɔ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wu ayɛɛn, yɔɔl kwɛn wu akeyɛɛn tsɔɔn akal pi. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ke yam, byɛ bueel ekoo k'eyɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, m'ɔ̃mɔ̃ ɔ̃mɔ̃, kwɛn bueel akal y'ãyal, bvool awam. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ali y'okwɛn nkal ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'ali Nziã wu ɛ̃tswab wɛ, ndɛ oli Nziã wu opi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Onge b'abesa onse Ãbvɔɔn mbueel mã ba ngel, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />yɔɔl kwɛn akaal akal pi k'ãmboo m'obvɔɔn. Ke ngwel wɛ, k'awi bɔ nkuul yi ayɛɛn onse mɔ̃ wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ akal ye lweel, onge b'etam Ngel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:16">Obɛ 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:12">1Ti 2.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Okɛɛn bɔ adzii k'ayɛɛ ndɔɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ afuul alam k'ãnzɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, k'eli ngesɛ wɛ kwɛn ɔ̃kaal ayɛɛn onse Ebvɔɔn.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Byɛ etsam wɛn Endɔɔ e Nziã ola byɛ efi? Wuo lɔ eyi kɛn ola byam atu? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri ndɛ oli wu ayɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, wuo Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal abiri ndɛ, ebvaan ndɛ ayɛɛ kwɛn m'ekel mɛ̃ ãli m'etam Mfam osa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Kɛn okɛɛn ndɛ k'ayɛɛ obobɔ wɛ, ŋɛn Nziã hɛ̃ k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Obobɔ, andoo, ekal ye nzal a k'eyɛɛn ɛ̃kiɛɛn ɛ̃ Nziã, kɛn ebee bakyɛ oluo k'ayɛɛn ɛ̃nywã. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn asa mbueel m'emfa ki ngesɛ bvool m'emfa ki eywɛn ɛ̃tswab.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi eyɔɔ Pool bvool otee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Andoo, mɛ̃ ŋ'eyeel byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi étee mɛ̃ byɛ. Nsia yi éyɔɔ byɛ, bvool ékuru nzuru me yɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Byɛ ebvuul me yɔ, okɛɛn byɛ ekwɛɛ yɔ onge b'etee mɛ̃ byɛ yɔ. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, okiool o byɛ otsɛn pyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Mɛ̃ éyiool byɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ãndɔɔ m'éyɔɔ myam wɛn: Mãsia okwi me ndɔɔ ãbi ã bia-byɛ, onge b'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Adziool ndɛ, ndɛ osiool me tsoo li ãtyel, onge b'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Ndɛ opal ola Sefas, bvool opal ol'antam kuun ye buaal. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opal ol'andoo ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500) y'esiɔ ekuu emɔ̃. Bibi onse bɔ ali kɛn mwiĩ, bakyɛ ámaakwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opal ola Dzak, bvool opal ol'antam bueel.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ke mbee a bɔ bueel, ndɛ opal ola mɛ̃, mɛ̃ wɛn onge muaan wɛn nswii k'ékoo wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ngwanyã, mɛ̃ wu mvool mbee onse antam. Ke yam, mɛ̃ ke mvaan kwɛn ata mɛ̃ me ntam wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ étueel Ebvɔɔn e Nziã mpal. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Kɛn a me nyiĩ a Nziã, mɛ̃ ndi m'emfa ki ndi mɛ̃ nonɔ̃, bvool nyiĩ a ndɛ ola mɛ̃ k'eli yi ngwel wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ nsi ɔ̃sal wu onduru wa bɔ bueel. Ke yam, k'eli mɛ̃ wɛ, eli nyiĩ a Nziã yi eli ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Obobɔ, ekal mɛ̃, ekal bɔ, oyɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ebetee bee bueel, bvool yi ekiool byɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />K'okɛɛn abetee ndiri Mãsia osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, emfa emã kyɛn bakyɛ onse byɛ abeyɛɛn ndiri b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Okɛɛn b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, ŋɛn Mãsia k'asiool hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Bvool okɛɛn Mãsia k'asiool wɛ, ŋɛn ãtee ã bee ãli mã ngwel, okiool o byɛ hɛ̃ oli bo ngwel. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Okɛɛn taa-taa b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, ŋɛn Nziã k'áseel Mãsia onse b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, bee ŋ'eli atsweel ba mfya, ke ngwel wɛ bee etsweel ke nkwel a Nziã wɛn ndɛ oseel Mãsia onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, Mãsia hɛ̃ ŋɛn k'asiool wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Okɛɛn Mãsia k'asiool wɛ, okiool o byɛ oli bo ngwel, bvool byɛ eli kɛn onse ãbi ã byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Ŋɛn hɛ̃ b'ákwi onse okiool me Mãsia ayɛn nkel. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Okɛɛn kaã li eti bia-byɛ me Mãsia li ekal bia-byɛ kɛn a m'omwiĩ ba, bia-byɛ ŋ'eli baal b'anduru baal bueel me fool.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kɛn a Mãsia osiool bam taa-taa onse b'ákwi-ákwi. Ndɛ oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onge bɛn epfu eyi me mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, emfa kiki hɛ̃ osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi oyi me mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn baal bueel akwa me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ali me bvoo y'Ãdam, emfa kiki hɛ̃ baal bueel akieel asiool, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ali me bvoo ye Mãsia, <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />kɛn a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'ɔ̃nkaal a ndɛ: Mãsia mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ba Mãsia akieel asiool ŋ'èya ndɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bu eyii ntɔ yɛn Mãsia akieel abiil mpɛn yueel, ye waan lueel y'okwɛn bueel. Obobɔ, ndɛ àbveel okwɛn ola Nziã wu Taal. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan ndɛ akal y'okwɛn, tiil k'elɔ ndɛ ataal bueel ke nsɛn a ntaã e ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ãnz 110.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Ɔ̃taal wu ambee wu akieel abiil, eli epfu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ngwanyã, «ndɛ olɔ mbueel ke nsɛn a ntaã e ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:7">Ãnz 8.7</ref></char></note>.» Kɛn a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri áwi ndɛ okwɛn nkal a mbueel, eli kal-a-kal kwɛn ŋ'ambaal wu áwi ndɛ okwɛn nkal a mbueel. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ŋ'akieel awa ndɛ okwɛn nkal a mbueel, Muaan ndyam akieel akal ke nsɛn a wu owi ndɛ okwɛn nkal a mbueel, kwɛn Nziã akal y'okwɛn b'ɔ̃koo nkal a mbueel.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />K'okɛɛn b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, b'abewal opongo me ndɔɔ a b'ákwi-ákwi asa emã? Okɛɛn b'áki-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, ke m'emã bɔ abewal opongo me ndɔɔ a bɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Ke bee, otsɛn omã b'abebii bee obam ãlio mbueel? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Andoo, tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, mɛ̃ ebewa nkii a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ otaa-taa ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ebebɛɛl ntwel me byɛ onse bvoo ye Yeso Mãsia, wu Mfam a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />K'Efedze, mɛ̃ nzwaan ye baal bɛn onge anyam a mpuru. K'okɛɛn mvel oyɔ kɛn a me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ombuul, oŋɔ̃ bvel emã li mbɔɔ mɛ̃? Okɛɛn b'ákwi-ákwi k'asiool wɛ, oŋɔ̃ «bia-byɛ edza bvool enywã, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃suu bia-byɛ èkwa», onge b'ebeyɛɛn baal.<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Ekal y'onkyab! Ke ngwel wɛ, «andoo b'abi-abi abebiil epfuũ bvi ngesɛ». <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ebveel ãtsam ã byɛ mã ngesɛ, bvool ebee obi osa! Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bakyɛ onse byɛ k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ, kwɛn byɛ eyoo opfuru.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuru yi ekieel esiool a baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Kɛn a baal bakyɛ akoo k'afuul bubu: «B'ákwi-ákwi bwɛn-a-bwɛn asiool? Nzuru yi esiool bɔ ye yɔ, yi bwɛn-a-bwɛn?» <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Yɛ mbuul wu oywɛn ãyal li! Ŋ'ekwɛn yɛ esia, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn lɔ ekwa ye k'ekɔɔl lɔ ɔ̃ti. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ki ebekwɛn yɛ eli esia etu, ekoo k'ekal li bele, ekoo k'ekal esia ekyam, k'ɔ̃ti ndyam wu àyemɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Nziã awa esia olɔ nzuru, onge b'edzii ndɛ. Ndɛ abewa esia bwɛn esia nzuru yi ebvaan me lɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Nzuru yueel k'efɛɛn a yinkyɛ wɛ: Nzuru yɛn yi baal, yɛn yi anyam, yɛn yi anywɛn, yɛn hɛ̃ yi answi. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Eli hɛ̃ y'ãnzuru mã ywel, ye mã nsie. Ongal b'ãnzuru mã ywel okam y'ongal b'ãnzuru mã nsie. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Tal eli y'ongal o lɔ, nswii y'ongal o ndɛ, angam-a-ngam y'ongal o bɔ. Onkyam ngam-a-ngam k'angal emfa ngemɔ̃ ye wukyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Eli emfa kiki me b'otal osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi: Adziool nzuru m'emfa ki ebwal, yɔ esiool m'emfa kyɛn k'ebwal wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Adziool yɔ onse opfuru, yɔ esiool ye lweel. Adziool yɔ onse okwal, yɔ esiool ye mpɛn yam. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ŋ'adziool yɔ, yɔ eli nzuru yi ombuul. Ŋ'esiool yɔ, yɔ eli nzuru yi ɔ̃fel. Eli ye nzuru y'ombuul, eli hɛ̃ ye nzuru y'ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ákel bubu: «Ãdam wu mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel, oyii mbuul wa mwiĩ, y'omwiĩ b'ombuul<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Obɛ 2.7</ref></char></note>.» Ãdam wu ãmbee oyii Ɔ̃fel wu awa elaã. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ki eya ɛ̃kwel, eli ki ombuul, ke ki ɔ̃fel wɛ. Ki ɔ̃fel eya ãmbee. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu ábuo m'ɔ̃fel a nsie oli mbuul wa nsie. Mbuul wa buaal ofi ywel. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Baal a nsie ali onge wu ébuo Nziã me nsie. Kɛn a baal ba ywel ali onge wu ofi ywel. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ ki eli bia-byɛ y'emfa e mbuul wu ási m'ɔ̃fel a nsie, emfa kiki hɛ̃ bia-byɛ ekieel ekal y'emfa e mbuul wa ywel.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Andoo, etal be nzii mɛ̃ oliaal: Eluɔ kieel ki eli ye tuo y'ãkel k'ekoo k'ewal ɔ̃swal wu Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ. Eluɔ ki ebwal k'ekoo k'ekal y'elaã lɛn ntɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mɛ̃ ŋ'eyɛɛn byɛ ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi m'edziɔɔn: Bia-byɛ bueel kieel k'akwa wɛ, kɛn a bia-byɛ bueel ekieel eswɛɛl emfa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />me lio etsi-tsiri, bam tswa-a-tswa, ŋ'ekieel ebel mvel-a-mvel wu ãmbee. Ngwanyã, mvel-a-mvel akieel abel, bvool b'ákwi-ákwi akieel asiool ye nzuru yɛn kieel k'ebekwa bvool wɛ, bvool bia-byɛ bam ekieel eswɛɛl emfa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn ki ebwal elaal nzuru yɛn k'ebwal wɛ, ki ekwa hɛ̃ elaal nzuru yɛn k'ekwa wɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ŋ'ekieel elaal ki ebwal nzuru yɛn k'ebwal wɛ, bvool ki ekwa elaal elaã lɛn ntɔ pyɛ, oŋɔ̃ kieel ŋ'asi m'ákel ndiri: «Abvel epfu mpɛn m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo.»<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />«Ee epfu, obvel o yɛ a bɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Ee epfu, waan e yɛ a lɔ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Edz 25.8</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Mpɛn a epfu eli obi, waan li obi eli Ngel. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn bia-byɛ elweel Nziã, ndɛ owi bia-byɛ obvel me Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />M'emfa okyɛ, andoo, esɛn ãnã bvool ebee otsiɔ̃! Eyi nkwel kɛn oyi onse ɔ̃sal a Mfam. Eyɛɛ wɛn ɔ̃sal a byɛ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ k'àkal wa ngwel wɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ta me ndɔɔ Ebvɔɔn li Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Me b'otal ɔ̃ta wu esa me ndɔɔ a ba ngel, mɛ̃ elieel ãbvɔɔn mã nsie yi Ngalati ãndɔɔ m'asa. Byɛ hɛ̃ èsa onge bɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse byɛ, ke nzɔ a ndɛ, bɛɛn tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li eyenge, asuul eluɔ kyɛn ndɛ okoo k'awa me pyɛ, m'emfa ki obɔɔ o ndɛ, kwɛn abee mɛ̃ okiaal m'osa b'ɔ̃ta. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ŋ'ekieel eya mɛ̃ okɔ, mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl baal b'esueel byɛ Yelusalem. Mɛ̃ kieel ewa bɔ ɛ̃nkaan mi ewa bɔ nkuul yi abiri ãkab ã byɛ okɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Okɛɛn ebvaan kwɛn myam eyi, bɔ akieel ayi ye mɛ̃.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃yɛɛl mi ɛ̃tal dzwɛ e Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Ŋ'ekieel eyebwel mɛ̃ me li Maseduaan, mɛ̃ èyetal byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ekieel ebwel m'ɔlɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Owɛɛl mɛ̃ ekieel ekal ola byɛ, owɛɛl hɛ̃ lio e mfyɛ ekoo m'obwel mɛ̃ okɔ, kwɛn byam ewa mɛ̃ bvi ndi a mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ, me ndɔɔ yi enɔɔn mɛ̃ dzwɛ e mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke nzii kɛn a k'etal byɛ wɛ ŋ'èbwel mɛ̃. Okɛɛn Mfam owi nkuul, mɛ̃ etsam mpii mɛ̃ èyekal etso-tsoo ye byɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ekieel ekal k'Efedze tiil tsoo e Pantekote. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ mbɔɔ mpwee yi esa kwɛn mɛ̃ nsa ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃nɛn, kɛn ataal ali bibi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Okɛɛn Timote otɔ ola byɛ, esa kwɛn ndɛ abee ye buɔ okal, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ abesa ɔ̃sal a Mfam onge mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ abee ndɛ ngwel owal! Ewuaal a ndɛ me bvieel bvi eli a ndɛ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ, kwɛn ndɛ anɔɔn dzwɛ e ndɛ onse opi tiil k'eya ndɛ ola mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ y'andoo ebekiaal ndɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Me b'otal ndoo a bia-byɛ Apolos, mɛ̃ bam ngwi ndɛ luo kwɛn ndɛ y'andoo ayetal byɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'adzii k'aya okɔ meba wɛ. Ŋ'èbɔɔ ndɛ mpwee, ndɛ àya.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyɛɛn y'ɔ̃bio wa ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ, esɛn ãnã onse okiool, ekal y'onzɔɔ̃, ekal ye mpɛn! <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Yɔɔl kwɛn bye esa mbueel ye dzii!<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn Sitefanas ye nzɔ a ndɛ ali akiool b'ɛ̃kwel b'Akayi, bɔ hɛ̃ asi ɔ̃sal me ndɔɔ ba ngel. M'emfa okyɛ, andoo, mɛ̃ nsɔɔ byɛ bubu osa: <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Elweel baal b'obobɔ, ye baal b'abesal ye bɔ bvool abemwɛn fool m'ɔ̃sal.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Mɛ̃ esia mpal me ndɔɔ yi eli Sitefanas, ye Fɔɔtunatus, ye Akayikos ŋã. Bɔ awel mboo a byɛ ola mɛ̃. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ amvieel ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ efyɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ amvieel wa byɛ efyɛ. Eyɛɛ k'etuɛɛn baal ba m'emfa okyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Ãbvɔɔn mã nsie yi Adzi ãbio byɛ. Akilas ye Pilisile, bwɛn ebvɔɔn li onse nzɔ a bɔ, bɔ bueel abio byɛ me bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Andoo bueel abio byɛ. Ebio bakyɛ m'ɔ̃bio wa ngel.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ ɔ̃bio wu me kuɔɔl e myam.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Okɛɛn mbuul k'adzii Mfam wɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn abwel ndɛ enkɛɛ! Malanata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malanata, eli m'ɔ̃nywã wu Alameyɛ̃, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri Mfam ya!</char></note>!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam Yeso asio byɛ nyiĩ!<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Mɛ̃ nzii byɛ bueel onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>